                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Hmmph. I'm skeptical, a little irritated even, but all right. Wizard, we don't allow tourists here. You will be an Initiate... for now.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_POL_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You must begin by going to the Repository to study the Arcanum Creed. That will give Baba Yaga and myself time to... catch up.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_POL_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "So you managed to figure out the Creed. I feel surprise, but not disappointment. Perhaps Baba Yaga's assessment was not entirely wrong.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_POL_07.mp3",
